graph TB
    User1["👤 User on Web<br/>Browser Session"]
    User2["👤 Same User on Mobile<br/>Android App<br/>Same Firebase Account"]

    subgraph Web["🌐 Web Client"]
        WebUI["React UI<br/>Dashboard<br/>Course Catalog"]
        WebCache["TanStack Query<br/>Cache Layer"]
    end

    subgraph Mobile["📱 Mobile Client"]
        MobileUI["Android UI<br/>Fragments<br/>Screens"]
        MobileCache["ViewModel<br/>LiveData<br/>Local Cache"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["🖥️ Shared Backend<br/>Spring Boot /api/v1"]
        Auth["Auth Service"]
        Courses["Course Service"]
        Enrollments["Enrollment Service"]
        Progress["Progress Service"]
    end

    subgraph DB["💾 Single Database<br/>PostgreSQL"]
        Users["users table<br/>user_id | firebase_uid | email"]
        Enroll_Table["enrollments table<br/>user_id | course_id | enrolled_at"]
        Progress_Table["progress table<br/>user_id | lesson_id | watched"]
    end

    User1 -->|Logs in| WebUI
    User2 -->|Logs in| MobileUI

    WebUI -->|Query /enrollments| WebCache
    MobileUI -->|Query /enrollments| MobileCache

    WebCache -->|GET /enrollments| Enrollments
    MobileCache -->|GET /enrollments| Enrollments

    Enrollments -->|Enroll in Course A| Enroll_Table

    Enrollments -->|Response: Enrollment Created| WebCache
    Enrollments -->|Response: Enrollment Created| MobileCache

    WebCache -->|Display| WebUI
    MobileCache -->|Display| MobileUI

    WebUI -->|Both see:<br/>Course A enrolled| User1
    MobileUI -->|Both see:<br/>Course A enrolled| User2

    Progress -->|POST /progress<br/>lesson_id watched| Progress_Table
    Progress -->|GET /progress| MobileCache
    Progress -->|GET /progress| WebCache

    WebCache -->|Refresh| WebUI
    MobileCache -->|Update LiveData| MobileUI

    style DB fill:#e1f5ff
    style Backend fill:#f3e5f5
    style Web fill:#fff3e0
    style Mobile fill:#e8f5e9